{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:16 2026-08-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:46 2026-08-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:46 2026-08-25 HKT</p><p>大嶼山翔東路近欣澳，今日（8月25日）晚上近8時有3車相撞，涉及愉景灣巴士、貨車及的士，初步有10人受傷，包括巴士上8人、的士司機以及的士乘客。其中的士車頭嚴重損毀，司機被困昏迷。警方消防接報趕至救援，將傷者分送北大嶼山醫院及瑪嘉烈醫院救治。</p><img alt=\"其中一名傷者送瑪嘉烈醫院救治。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f0fc3bd24f14924450da3fa4f58ffff/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_13_33_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"的士司機送北大嶼山醫院搶救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e7e218c4eef2d88a30ca8dbb95ec871/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_14_27.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救援。FB：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f687e6ec81feacf0aeb7ad2854ef764d/2026-08/787287909_1530509218392664_3550630365972574785_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"的士迎頭硬撼巴士，車頭嚴重損毀。FB：Jack Son@馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d78e979e2fb9c06b4a74e0118be7354/2026-08/784240400_813751988466483_8239432965787803164_n_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者坐地待救。FB：Jack Son@馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c465f42ac2fd671d1e32c8c71d365e0/2026-08/786853766_1701845521116484_658848858148516294_n.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者坐地待救。FB：Jack Son@馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f5dbe69e01c93382732b945767ac9c4/2026-08/786854690_1352611366723830_2224045655260401220_n.jpeg\"/><p>目前車禍原因仍在調查。受意外影響期間，翔東路(來回方向)近欣澳的全線封閉，同時北大嶼山公路(往機場方向)的慢線封閉，上址交通繁忙。</p><img alt=\"部分輕傷傷者可自行步入急症室。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7fbea9dea73ae46651f6be6ba0b6ca1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_29_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者陸續送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdb6962e4c38c106d402a4b49b5a5006/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_36_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者陸續送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c1e6806b23f938dc9ebf732d59d529f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_36_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b97cd42d1f505605a18ffbc238855db/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_24_48.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42819b3410ce1d78a57ddaded4b8a750/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_24_49_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場一片狼藉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95e459a8fa008fc738b616d7774347f8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_21_30_10.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T13:59:46.989739+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}